I've finished P22: toasts, the box-select popover and the dialogs now follow premium §7.13, §7.14 and §7.16. Typecheck and lint are clean, all 309 unit tests pass (51 files), and the related e2e specs pass on a fresh build. P22 is ticked in `tasks.md` and the entry is in `logs/progress.md`.

**Toasts (§7.13, A34)**
- **Look:** toasts sit bottom-centre, 24 px from the bottom (16 px plus the safe area on mobile), on `material-thick` with `shadow-popover`. They are 380 px wide at most, use radius 16 and padding 12 16, and lay out as icon, text, action.
- **Behaviour:** they last 4 s, at most 3 show at once, and hover or focus pauses the timer. Sonner only pauses on hover, so focus is handled by a small listener in `toaster.tsx`.
- **Icons:** all icons are grey (`text-secondary`).
- **Error toast:** the "file ends mid-record" toast stays until dismissed and has a 24 px "Dismiss" ✕ button.

**Selection popover (§7.14)**
- It is now 240 px wide on `material-thick` and reads "148 dies selected", "31 failed, 79.1% yield" and "Most loss: SBIN 7", then "Clear" and an "Esc" keycap. The bin code is not translated.
- I removed the "Zoom to selection" button and its handler, because §7.14 lists only Clear and Esc.

**Dialogs (§7.16)**
- Every dialog has a "Close" ✕ button on desktop, 16 px from the top-right corner.
- The error-details dialog is 560 px wide and uses the `title-2` size for its title.

**Strings:** I added 3 strings (`selection.summary`, `selection.mostLoss`, `sheet.close`), removed 4, and reworded "N dies selected". All 5 locales still match, at 241 keys.

**Tests**
- **New:** `e2e/toasts-sheets-p22.spec.ts` checks A34 (the download toast's style and that it leaves after about 4 s; the error toast staying until dismissed) and the error-details dialog. It also writes 3 screenshots to `logs/shots/`. `selection-popover.test.ts` checks the popover content, and extra checks in `primitives.test.ts` cover the toast and dialogs.
- **Updated:** `linked-interactions-r7` for the new popover wording.
- **Also passing:** `landing-r4`, `loading-error-p14`, `primitives-p15`. No snapshots changed.

**Decisions where premium.md is silent (logged)**
- Parse-warning toasts are now notices: info icon and 4 s, down from 6 s.
- The download toast has no icon.
- Sonner runs in its `light` mode in both app themes, because its dark mode overrode our description and close-button colours.
- The "Most loss" line is hidden when the selection has no failing dies.
- Pressing Esc while the Clear button has focus also clears the selection.
- Dialog titles get 24 px right padding on desktop so they don't run under the ✕ button.

`logs/p22.*`, `logs/prompt-p22.txt` and the change to `logs/p21.out` were already there before I started, so I left them alone. The p14 e2e spec rewrote its own screenshot, `logs/shots/p14-bins-only-1440-light.png`, when it ran.[INFO] [KRS] <-- GenerateAssistantResponseCommand done totalEvents=197

